<title>USA: Compass unit to acquire Bank One branch.</title>
<headline>Compass unit to acquire Bank One branch.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compass Bancshares Inc said on Monday its Texas subsidiary Compass Bank signed a definitive agreement to acquire Banc One Corp's Bank One, Texas, unit's Crosby, Texas, location with $28 million in deposits.</p>
<p>The cash transaction, subject to regulatory approval, is expected to be completed in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Compass Bancshares is an $11.6 billion bank holding company with a capital base of $777 million in the first nine months of 1996.</p>
</text>
